 "kind": "skill",
 "definition": "Raising and bringing together the funds, people and materials an organisation or programme needs, especially in non-profit and development work.",
 "description": {
  "text": "The process of getting resources from resource providers, by various mechanisms, to meet an organization's goals, acquiring them in a timely and cost-effective way. It is also a theory in social movement studies holding that success depends on resources such as time, money and skills.",
